{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"氣象冷知識｜雲寶寶身世之謎(上)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-01-08-22-16MTngTvbo.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】抬頭望天，不能發現天上的雲總是變幻萬千。雲究竟是如何形成的？不同的雲又有甚麼特徵差異？第五百一十五集「氣象冷知識」為你揭開雲層形成的機制。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:04.649836+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T01:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:38:55.790559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:55.638554+00:00","content_hash":"b16c82c155e1eacf960527371260929cb2fd9fd2313b161692e113f384588b41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:04.649836+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}